674
00:58:32.291 --> 00:58:34.544
They're celebrating!

675
00:58:34.627 --> 00:58:38.715
They're thanking us
for doing such a good job.

676
00:58:38.798 --> 00:58:43.678
Whoa! Careful down there.
You almost hit us!

677
00:58:43.761 --> 00:58:47.557
It's okay, Zero. Head higher.

678
00:58:51.561 --> 00:58:54.564
Are you a gamblin' man, Sandy?

679
00:58:54.647 --> 00:58:58.276
Let's play. Hmm?

680
00:58:59.819 --> 00:59:04.407
My, my! What have we here?

681
00:59:14.083 --> 00:59:16.335
I'll get you out of here.

682
00:59:16.419 --> 00:59:20.298
Ah. Lovely.

683
00:59:20.381 --> 00:59:23.593
Tickle, tickle, tickle.
Uh, tickle, tickle, tickle.

684
00:59:23.676 --> 00:59:25.803
Tickle, tickle, tickle.
Tickle, tickle, tickle.

685
00:59:27.847 --> 00:59:33.436
What? You try to make
a dupe out of me!

686
00:59:41.361 --> 00:59:42.403
Oh!

687
00:59:44.280 --> 00:59:46.282
Who's next on my list?

688
00:59:46.366 --> 00:59:50.787
Ah, little Harry and Jordan.
Won't they be surprised?

689
01:00:02.715 --> 01:00:06.636
They're trying to hit us. Zero!

690
01:00:16.979 --> 01:00:19.399
Merry Christmas to all...

691
01:00:19.482 --> 01:00:25.238
and to all a good night!

692
01:00:43.339 --> 01:00:47.844
I knew this Christmas thing
was a bad idea.

693
01:00:47.927 --> 01:00:51.347
I felt it in my gut.

694
01:00:51.431 --> 01:00:54.225
Terrible news, folks.

695
01:00:54.308 --> 01:00:58.855
The worst tragedy of our times.

696
01:00:58.938 --> 01:01:04.277
Jack has been blown to smithereens!

697
01:01:04.360 --> 01:01:08.239
Terrible, terrible news!

698
01:01:10.283 --> 01:01:13.786
Attention. Attention, citizens.

699
01:01:13.870 --> 01:01:18.583
Terrible news. There's still
no sign of Santa Claus.

700
01:01:18.666 --> 01:01:22.003
Although the impostor
has been shot down...

701
01:01:22.086 --> 01:01:27.425
it looks like Christmas will
have to be cancelled this year.

702
01:01:27.508 --> 01:01:29.969
I repeat, the impostor
has been shot down...

703
01:01:31.721 --> 01:01:35.892
but there's still
no sign yet of Santa.

704
01:01:47.820 --> 01:01:54.494
<i>What have I done</i>

705
01:01:54.577 --> 01:01:57.830
<i>How could I</i>

706
01:01:57.914 --> 01:02:01.250
<i>Be so blind</i>

707
01:02:01.334 --> 01:02:04.545
<i>All is lost</i>

708
01:02:04.629 --> 01:02:08.049
<i>Where was I</i>

709
01:02:08.132 --> 01:02:14.889
<i>Spoiled all</i>

710
01:02:14.972 --> 01:02:18.142
<i>Everything's</i>

711
01:02:18.226 --> 01:02:21.604
<i>Gone all wrong</i>

712
01:02:21.688 --> 01:02:28.403
<i>What have I done</i>

713
01:02:28.486 --> 01:02:32.949
<i>Find a deep cave to hide in</i>

714
01:02:33.032 --> 01:02:35.993
<i>In a million years</i>

715
01:02:36.077 --> 01:02:40.915
<i>They'll find me only dust</i>

716
01:02:40.998 --> 01:02:45.378
<i>And a plaque that reads</i>

717
01:02:45.461 --> 01:02:50.675
<i>Here lies poor old Jack</i>

718
01:02:52.051 --> 01:02:57.056
<i>But I never intended
all this madness</i>

719
01:02:57.140 --> 01:02:58.641
<i>Never</i>

720
01:02:58.725 --> 01:03:02.812
<i>And nobody really understood</i>

721
01:03:02.895 --> 01:03:04.897
<i>Well, how could they</i>

722
01:03:04.981 --> 01:03:09.402
<i>That all I ever wanted was
to bring them something great</i>

723
01:03:09.485 --> 01:03:13.614
<i>Why does nothing ever
turn out like it should</i>

724
01:03:13.698 --> 01:03:16.409
<i>Well, what the heck</i>

725
01:03:16.492 --> 01:03:18.703
<i>I went and did my best</i>

726
01:03:18.786 --> 01:03:23.833
<i>And by God
I really tasted something swell</i>

727
01:03:23.916 --> 01:03:28.338
<i>And for a moment
why, I even touched the sky</i>

728
01:03:28.421 --> 01:03:32.800
<i>And at least I left some stories
they can tell, I did</i>

729
01:03:32.884 --> 01:03:37.138
<i>And for the first time
since I don't remember when</i>

730
01:03:37.221 --> 01:03:41.392
<i>I felt just like
my old bony self again</i>

731
01:03:41.476 --> 01:03:43.644
<i>And I, Jack</i>

732
01:03:43.728 --> 01:03:46.356
<i>The Pumpkin King</i>

733
01:03:46.439 --> 01:03:51.194
<i>That's right, I am the Pumpkin King
Ha-ha-ha-ha</i>

734
01:03:51.277 --> 01:03:54.989
<i>And I just can't wait
until next Halloween</i>

735
01:03:55.073 --> 01:03:59.285
<i>'Cause I've got some new ideas
that will really make them scream</i>

736
01:03:59.369 --> 01:04:04.540
<i>And by god I'm really
going to give it all my might</i>

737
01:04:04.624 --> 01:04:08.503
Uh-oh. I hope there's still time...

738
01:04:08.586 --> 01:04:12.048
to set things right.

739
01:04:12.131 --> 01:04:15.301
Sandy Claws! Hmm.

740
01:04:15.385 --> 01:04:17.679
You wait till Jack
hears about this!

741
01:04:17.762 --> 01:04:20.890
By the time he's through with
you, you'll be lucky if you...

742
01:04:20.973 --> 01:04:23.226
The King of Halloween...

743
01:04:23.309 --> 01:04:27.271
has been blown to smithereens.

744
01:04:27.355 --> 01:04:32.485
Skeleton Jack
is now a pile of dust.

745
01:04:32.652 --> 01:04:35.613
Come on, Zero.
Christmas isn't over yet.

746
01:04:43.538 --> 01:04:47.959
What's that you said
about luck, rag doll?

747
01:04:53.548 --> 01:04:57.093
Help! Help! Help!

748
01:04:57.176 --> 01:04:59.137
Shh.

749
01:05:01.389 --> 01:05:04.350
Looks like it's Oogie's turn
to boogie now.

750
01:05:04.434 --> 01:05:07.270
- Help!
- One, two, three...

751
01:05:07.353 --> 01:05:10.481
four, five, six, seven.

752
01:05:10.565 --> 01:05:12.859
Help!

753
01:05:14.193 --> 01:05:18.031
Ashes to ashes,
and dust to dust.

754
01:05:18.114 --> 01:05:22.785
Oh, I'm feeling weak with hunger!

755
01:05:22.869 --> 01:05:26.039
One more roll of the dice
oughta do it.

756
01:05:29.208 --> 01:05:31.961
What? Snake eyes?

757
01:05:33.671 --> 01:05:36.132
Eleven!

758
01:05:36.215 --> 01:05:40.011
Looks like I won the jackpot!

759
01:05:40.094 --> 01:05:45.308
Bye-bye, doll face and sandman.

760
01:05:48.186 --> 01:05:49.854
What the...

761
01:05:51.898 --> 01:05:54.901
- Hello, Oogie.
- J-J-J-Jack!

762
01:05:54.984 --> 01:06:00.323
But they said you were dead.
You must be double dead!

763
01:06:00.406 --> 01:06:02.075
Oh!

764
01:06:08.373 --> 01:06:11.834
Well, come on, bone man!

765
01:06:19.634 --> 01:06:22.345
Ooh-hoo-hoo-hoo! Ha!

766
01:06:27.016 --> 01:06:29.519
Fire!

767
01:06:31.896 --> 01:06:34.524
Hmm. Ooh-ooh-ooh!

768
01:06:41.114 --> 01:06:43.282
Jack, look out!

769
01:06:47.995 --> 01:06:50.206
So long, Jack.

770
01:06:52.333 --> 01:06:57.088
How dare you treat my friends
so shamefully!

771
01:07:02.051 --> 01:07:06.055
Now look what you've done!

772
01:07:06.139 --> 01:07:09.851
My bugs! My bugs!

773
01:07:09.934 --> 01:07:17.942
My bugs! My bugs! My bugs!

774
01:07:18.026 --> 01:07:21.112
My bugs! My bugs!

775
01:07:22.655 --> 01:07:24.615
Forgive me, Mr. Claws.

776
01:07:24.699 --> 01:07:26.909
I'm afraid I've made
a terrible mess of your holiday.

777
01:07:26.993 --> 01:07:30.204
Bumpy sleigh ride, Jack?

778
01:07:30.288 --> 01:07:35.460
The next time you get the urge to take over
someone else's holiday, I'd listen to her.

779
01:07:35.543 --> 01:07:39.255
She's the only one who makes any
sense around this insane asylum.

780
01:07:39.339 --> 01:07:43.009
- Skeletons! Boogie men! Ooh.
- I hope there's still time.

781
01:07:43.092 --> 01:07:46.471
To fix Christmas?
Of course there is!

782
01:07:46.554 --> 01:07:49.474
I'm Santa Claus.

783
01:07:53.936 --> 01:07:57.523
He'll fix things, Jack.
He knows what to do.

784
01:07:57.607 --> 01:07:59.776
How did you
get down here, Sally?

785
01:07:59.859 --> 01:08:04.322
Oh, I-I was trying to...
Well, I wanted to, to...

786
01:08:04.405 --> 01:08:07.033
- To help me.
- I couldn't let you just...

787
01:08:07.116 --> 01:08:11.120
Sally, I can't believe
I never realized that you...

788
01:08:11.204 --> 01:08:14.457
- Jack! Jack! -
Here he is! - Alive!

789
01:08:14.540 --> 01:08:17.960
- Just like we said!
- Grab a hold, my boy!

790
01:08:19.253 --> 01:08:21.130
Whoa!

791
01:08:21.214 --> 01:08:26.177
Good news, folks. Santa Claus, the one
and only, has finally been spotted.

792
01:08:26.260 --> 01:08:29.597
Old Saint Nick appears to be
traveling at supersonic speed.

793
01:08:29.681 --> 01:08:33.935
He's setting things right, bringing
joy and cheer wherever he goes.

794
01:08:34.018 --> 01:08:36.813
Yes, folks, Kriss Kringle
has pulled it out of the bag...

795
01:08:36.896 --> 01:08:41.693
and delivered Christmas
to excited children all over the world.

796
01:08:43.820 --> 01:08:48.199
<i>La, la, la, la
La-la-la-la</i>

797
01:08:48.282 --> 01:08:50.159
- Jack!
- Jack's back!

798
01:08:50.243 --> 01:08:53.538
- Jack? - Jack's okay! -
He's all right! - It's Jack!

799
01:08:53.621 --> 01:08:56.499
<i>Jack's okay
And he's back</i>

800
01:08:56.582 --> 01:08:59.043
<i>Oh, yea
He's all right</i>

801
01:08:59.127 --> 01:09:03.548
<i>Let's shout, make a fuss
Scream it out, whee</i>

802
01:09:03.631 --> 01:09:06.300
<i>Jack is back now
Everyone sing</i>

803
01:09:06.384 --> 01:09:10.013
<i>In the town of Halloween</i>

804
01:09:10.096 --> 01:09:13.683
- It's great to be home!
- Ho-ho-ho-ho!

805
01:09:15.351 --> 01:09:18.104
Happy Halloween!

806
01:09:18.187 --> 01:09:22.233
Merry Christmas!

807
01:09:22.316 --> 01:09:25.069
<i>- What's this - What's
this - I haven't got a clue</i>

808
01:09:25.153 --> 01:09:27.363
<i>- What's this
- Why, it's completely new</i>

809
01:09:27.447 --> 01:09:29.490
<i>What's this
Must be a Christmas thing</i>

810
01:09:29.574 --> 01:09:32.368
<i>- What's this
- It's really very strange</i>

811
01:09:39.751 --> 01:09:43.171
<i>This is Halloween
Halloween, Halloween, Halloween</i>

812
01:09:43.254 --> 01:09:45.048
<i>What's this
What's this</i>

813
01:09:50.386 --> 01:09:53.556
Careful, my precious jewel.

814
01:10:19.374 --> 01:10:25.129
<i>My dearest friend
if you don't mind</i>

815
01:10:25.213 --> 01:10:31.511
<i>I'd like to join you by your side</i>

816
01:10:31.594 --> 01:10:37.892
<i>Where we can gaze
into the stars</i>

817
01:10:37.975 --> 01:10:42.271
<i>And sit together</i>

818
01:10:42.355 --> 01:10:46.526
<i>Now and forever</i>

819
01:10:46.609 --> 01:10:49.946
<i>For it is plain</i>

820
01:10:50.029 --> 01:10:54.117
<i>As anyone can see</i>

821
01:10:54.200 --> 01:11:00.248
<i>We're simply meant to be</i>
